  "system": {
    "identifier": "medical-release-death-ward",
    "description": "<p>You draw your chakra seal onto a talesman and place it onto a creature other than yourself, granting it a measure of protection from death. The first time the target would drop to 0 hit points as a result of taking damage, the target instead stops at 1 hit point, and the jutsu ends. If this jutsu is still in effect when the target is subjected to an effect that would kill it instantly without dealing damage, excluding Exhaustion, that effect is instead dispelled and the jutsu ends.</p>",
